CREATED:20240523T145051Z
DESCRIPTION:Complete the following steps to prepare for your appointment:\n
 \n- Measure twice. Make sure your new product will fit in its space and alo
 ng the path we will be using to get it there. Pay particular attention to d
 oorways\, hallways\, corners and tight spaces.\n\n- For tips and videos on 
 how to measure for success visit http://www.bestbuy.com/measure\n\n- Clear 
 a path for our team from the street to the product’s location in the home. 
 This includes removal of snow and ice\, opening gates and moving furniture 
 and fragile items.\n\n- Get property management approval in advance if any 
 policies or restrictions apply to your appointment. Examples include homeow
 ner's associations\, rental properties and military bases.\n\n- An adult\, 
 age 18 or over (19 or over in AL or NE\, 21 in Puerto Rico)\, with a valid 
 government issued photo ID must be present during the duration of the appoi
 ntment.\n\n- Secure your pets during the time of your appointment.\n\n- If 
 you had accessories\, parts or additional products shipped to your home tha
 t are needed for the appointment\, ensure they have arrived and are availab
 le for our team.\n\n- Ensure that adequate parking space is available\, par
 ticularly if you live in an area with limited or restricted parking.
LAST-MODIFIED:20240523T145051Z
LOCATION:
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TV/Display Setup & Mounting\, up to 55”
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
