 ctice policies\, and gather your verbal consent to begin care via telethera
 py.\n\nWelcome to Two Chairs! We look forward to connecting you to care.\n\
 nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/alexandria-jones-ma-lmft-b35a5520?utm_source=s
 hare&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app\n\n-::~:
