SUMMARY:Event: In-Person Hearing with Administrative Law Judge (ALJ)  📅 Da
 te: May 14\, 2025 🕚 Time: 11:15 a.m. PT 📍 Location: 1610 Arden Way\, Ste.
  250\, Sacramento\, CA 95815  Reminders & To-Do List:  ✅ One Month Before (
 April 14\, 2025\, at 9:00 a.m.) •Confirm receipt of the hearing notice. •Re
 view case documents & evidence. •Contact attorney (if applicable).  ✅ One W
 eek Before (May 7\, 2025\, at 9:00 a.m.) •Organize all necessary paperwork.
  •Confirm travel and parking plans. •Review case strategy.  ✅ Two Days Befo
 re (May 12\, 2025\, at 9:00 a.m.) •Double-check key documents. •Plan outfit
  & check travel route.  ✅ One Day Before (May 13\, 2025\, at 9:00 a.m.) •Pa
 ck documents\, ID\, and any needed materials. •Charge phone and devices. •S
 et out formal attire.  ✅ Hearing Day (May 14\, 2025) ⏰ 8:00 a.m. – Final do
 cument check. ⏰ 8:30 a.m. – Depart for hearing. ⏰ 10:30 a.m. – Arrive & che
 ck in. ⏰ 11:15 a.m. – Hearing begins.
